  "description": "BOLSEC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H126 Dy4 Mn3 N10 O34,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2A (Mn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.191-3.582 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.57-103.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H138Dy4Mn3N14O34. Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Dy(III).",
